#: views/attributes.py:76
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Create a new product attribute with optional values.\n"
"\n"
"    Example request:\n"
"    ```json\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"name\": \"Color\",\n"
"        \"type\": \"color\",\n"
"        \"values\": [\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Red\", \"color_hex\": \"#FF0000\", \"sort_order\": 0},\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Blue\", \"color_hex\": \"#0000FF\", \"sort_order\": 1}\n"
"        ]\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    एक नया उत्पाद गुण बनाएं जिसमें वैकल्पिक मान हो सकते हैं।\n"
"\n"
"उदाहरण अनुरोध:\n"
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"        \"name\": \"Color\",\n"
"        \"type\": \"color\",\n"
"        \"values\": [\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Red\", \"color_hex\": \"#FF0000\", \"sort_order\": 0},\n"
"            {\"value\": \"Blue\", \"color_hex\": \"#0000FF\", \"sort_order\": 1}\n"
"        ]\n"
"    }\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**अनुमान सीमा:** प्रति मिनट 30 अनुरोध (संवेदनशील कार्य)\n"
"    "

