"    individual failures do not affect other orders in the batch.\n"
"\n"
"    For each order:\n"
"    - Status is updated to 'shipped'\n"
"    - Tracking number is set on the order (if provided)\n"
"    - shipped_at timestamp is recorded in order metadata\n"
"    "
